From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Bruno=20Greg=C3=B3rio?= <accounts@bruno.pw>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 15:17:13 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: sm6450-sony-xperia-columbia-pdx246: Add the
 main camera's focus
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The IMX582 module focuses with an AK7374 voice coil driver at 0x0f on the
same CCI bus, powered from the camera PMIC's VAF rail. Describe it and
link it to the sensor.

Signed-off-by: Bruno Gregório <accounts@bruno.pw>
---
 .../dts/qcom/sm6450-sony-xperia-columbia-pdx246.dts   | 11 +++++++++++
 1 file changed, 11 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6450-sony-xperia-columbia-pdx246.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6450-sony-xperia-columbia-pdx246.dts
index cd2ca63e7..882bda8d7 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6450-sony-xperia-columbia-pdx246.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6450-sony-xperia-columbia-pdx246.dts
@@ -482,6 +482,15 @@ &cci0 {
 };
 
 &cci0_i2c0 {
+	/* The main camera's focus. */
+	cam_main_vcm: camera-lens@f {
+		compatible = "asahi-kasei,ak7374";
+		reg = <0x0f>;
+
+		vdd-supply = <&cam_main_vaf_2p8>;
+		vio-supply = <&cam_vio_1p8>;
+	};
+
 	/* The main camera. */
 	camera@1a {
 		compatible = "sony,imx582";
@@ -500,6 +509,8 @@ camera@1a {
 		pinctrl-0 = <&cam_mclk0_default &cam_main_reset>;
 		pinctrl-names = "default";
 
+		lens-focus = <&cam_main_vcm>;
+
 		orientation = <1>;
 		rotation = <270>;
 
